[{"title":"春兴八首 其八","author":"李东阳","text":"小叠峰峦浅作池，幽堂长是见春迟。\n风传翠筱声先到，雨换青松叶未知。\n江上帆樯经几驻，城南第宅已三移。\n君恩若放山林去，始是云霄得意时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12100,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中言怀四首 其一","author":"李东阳","text":"三年病后强趋朝，又拥重门卧寂寥。\n梦绕千山心不定，枕欹双臂力全消。\n笼灯月暗疑无影，园雪风稀未满条。\n睡起忽然忘握髻，不胜愁鬓晚飘萧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12101,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中言怀四首 其二","author":"李东阳","text":"瓦炉初冷更添香，更漏沉沉月转廊。\n身老病随年共至，愁多心与夜争长。\n尘编倦拂时防蠹，垄树新移尚怯霜。\n自笑闲情缘底在，向来公事已全荒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12102,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中言怀四首 其三","author":"李东阳","text":"身病何如目病难，极知昏眊胜衰残。\n愁来强阁东门泪，老去从欹杜甫冠。\n新酒纵篘仍断饮，好书虽借懒开看。\n枕边莫道无余事，犹有诗成字未安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12103,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中言怀四首 其四","author":"李东阳","text":"门掩疏篱雪满池，夜寒惟有病先知。\n冰轮影薄当窗近，竹叶声稀到枕迟。\n三径业荒秋去后，十年心苦梦醒时。\n一身经济元无术，医国如今合付谁？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12104,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊行二首柬张遂逸亲家 其一","author":"李东阳","text":"楼头钟鼓报新晴，又是城南一度行。\n刚得闲时身已老，未曾经处路犹生。\n平沙远水如江色，落叶疏林似雨声。\n欲问郊园幽寂地，野桥山寺不知名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12105,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊行二首柬张遂逸亲家 其二","author":"李东阳","text":"芒鞋随意踏青莎，一日溪头几度过。\n高树夕阳人影乱，断桥幽涧水声多。\n思乡拟作东都赋，远俗犹闻隔院歌。\n不向晚凉移席坐，好怀佳赏奈君何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12106,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游岳麓寺","author":"李东阳","text":"危峰高瞰楚江干，路在羊肠第几盘。\n万树松杉双径合，四山风雨一僧寒。\n平沙浅草连天在，落日孤城隔水看。\n蓟北湘南俱在眼，鹧鸪声里独凭栏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12107,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与赵梦麟诸人游甘露寺","author":"李东阳","text":"涧筱岩杉处处通，野寒吹雨堕空蒙。\n垂藤路绕千年石，老鹤巢倾半夜风。\n淮浦树来江口断，金陵潮落海门空。\n关书未报三边捷，万里中原一望中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12108,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泛南池有怀南溪圣公","author":"李东阳","text":"轻舟别浦路迢遥，危石虚亭影动摇。\n云去好山争入座，雨来新水欲平桥。\n多情留客空杯酒，旧事伤心但柳条。\n今日我来还我去，小山丛桂竟谁招。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12109,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次王古直哭兆先韵柬方石二首 其一","author":"李东阳","text":"刚道人琴一夜亡，故人明日报哀章。\n才如卞玉元居楚，业比童乌不姓杨。\n华表城头真浪语，干将地下有遗光。\n画图指点趋庭事，恨杀多情杜古狂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12110,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次王古直哭兆先韵柬方石二首 其二","author":"李东阳","text":"极知世事如春梦，不信人生是昼游。\n今日眼看埋玉树，当年心许撞烟楼。\n空烦挂剑来吴季，却悔藏书似邺侯。\n回首西湖湖上水，一时和泪共东流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12111,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻孔氏女至","author":"李东阳","text":"南风吹送北河舟，有女东来慰白头。\n病里心情无那老，别来风景又经秋。\n鹊声报日书先到，雨脚干时泪始收。\n预想离程还在眼，难将一笑解千忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12112,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄庄定山","author":"李东阳","text":"六峰东面一江横，此老逃名竟得名。\n山屋到秋惊雨破，野舟终日任潮生。\n消愁物已杯中办，得意诗从枕上成。\n三十年前携手地，寺门斜月晚钟声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12113,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄庄孔旸二首 其一","author":"李东阳","text":"买断溪南十顷烟，还家无复梦朝天。\n身如元亮归田日，诗似东坡过岭年。\n蓬岛谪来仙骨在，钓台高处客星悬。\n十年未洗红尘耳，谁听清风石上弦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12114,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄庄孔旸二首 其二","author":"李东阳","text":"背郭诛茅草盖堂，边江种柳树为墙。\n舟中梦醒闻春雨，楼上诗成坐夕阳。\n南纪壮游余岁月，北扉遗草旧封章。\n清时例有逃名客，见说严陵本姓庄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12115,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李提学若虚侯佥宪公矩","author":"李东阳","text":"十载同官别更同，一朝分送两青骢。\n湖南使节经江右，浙上行船过泖东。\n面带冰霜生朔气，手栽桃李待春风。\n他年冠佩还朝地，谁奏天曹第一功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12116,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送储静夫主事之南京吏部兼寄夏廷章","author":"李东阳","text":"万里晴空一鹤飞，野云溪雪避光辉。\n不应银海妨回棹，未许缁尘得上衣。\n南国地夸山水丽，东曹官爱簿书稀。\n多情定与吾乡彦，石假峰前咏落晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12117,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送范秋官以贞谪凤翔判得真字（吏部拟谪广南，特改兹郡）","author":"李东阳","text":"早闻长策动枫宸，十载郎官谪命新。\n家远漫为秦岭客，恩深不作播州人。\n一身且向闲时病，万事还从定后真。\n萧索郡斋山树里，坐看黄叶渐回春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12118,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送唐都宪出镇蓟州诸关","author":"李东阳","text":"居庸东下接榆关，千尺层城万仞山。\n秋有桑麻生事足，夜无烽火戍楼闲。\n帐前貔虎知严令，岁晚风霜识壮颜。\n略试一方经济手，归来重补旧朝班。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12119,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送蒋宗谊推官之金华","author":"李东阳","text":"北来南去几星霜，又见分符出帝乡。\n三入越山身更远，重游京国梦难忘。\n也知吏法兼诗老，未必才名与命妨。\n台省只今须俊杰，看骑骢马问豺狼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12120,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻刘东山司马致仕之命是日得谢方石祭酒到家日所寄诗感而有作","author":"李东阳","text":"十年两度送君归，听说乡山兴欲飞。\n岁久儿孙头角变，日长宾客往来稀。\n平桥着板通樵径，老树盘根作钓矶。\n强欲相从无旧业，定于何处解朝衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12121,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"木斋先生将登舟以诗见寄次韵二首 其一","author":"李东阳","text":"十年黄阁掌丝纶，共作先朝顾命臣。\n天外冥鸿君得志，池边蹲凤我何人。\n官曹入梦还如昨，世路论交半是新。\n仄柁欹帆何日定，茫茫尘海正无津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12122,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"木斋先生将登舟以诗见寄次韵二首 其二","author":"李东阳","text":"暂从中秘辍丝纶，同是羔羊退食臣。\n偶为庭花留坐客，岂知宫树管离人。\n杯余尚觉情难尽，棋罢惊看局又新。\n极目春明门外路，扁舟明日定天津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12123,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东山先生有两广之命奉寄","author":"李东阳","text":"听漏西堂黯不眠，忆君如在夜灯前。\n可堪环堵三年病，又上南州万里船。\n缩手未闲终坐巧，逾垣欲避转愁偏。\n行藏在我今须识，纵不由人也属天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12124,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"少保商先生寿七十","author":"李东阳","text":"白头归老荷君恩，一代勋名众所尊。\n自古年华稀七帙，本朝科甲重三元。\n海中仙子长生箓，洛下先生独乐园。\n怪见台光映东壁，郎官又侍紫微垣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12125,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭商裛衡侍讲","author":"李东阳","text":"科甲文章有父风，词林接武更谁同。\n讲经春殿炉烟暖，校艺秋闱烛影红。\n门阀并高缘有弟，头颅未白早称翁。\n生年五十还非夭，不道人间是梦中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12126,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭青溪倪太宰先生","author":"李东阳","text":"握手藤床肉未寒，重来不觉泪汍澜。\n山川一代英灵尽，人物三朝作养难。\n班史旧编家继有，山公新启世传看。\n平生爱国忧民意，仕路谁堪语肺肝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12127,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再哭青溪","author":"李东阳","text":"海内衣冠失老成，梦中精爽尚平生。\n杏园醉后千花拥，柳院归时一字行。\n旧事苍黄空过眼，暮年幽独转伤情。\n不须更作三同会，又听城西《薤露》声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12128,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"章恭毅公挽诗","author":"李东阳","text":"极知天下无难事，闻道先朝有直臣。\n万死不输三寸舌，一生谁是百年身。\n英灵地已归河岳，遗草天应护鬼神。\n欲殉朱云借时剑，九原重斩负恩人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12129,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨武选挽诗","author":"李东阳","text":"十载长安梦未醒，离堂风雨思冥冥。\n书随洛下舟中犬，身逐台南水上萍。\n卫国精灵应寂寞，郭家池馆半凋零。\n寡妻稚子衔哀意，谁作张圆死后铭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12130,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏台曲五首 其一","author":"李东阳","text":"秋水光于黛，新妆爱日斜。\n隔溪深不语，孤棹入菱花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12131,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏台曲五首 其二","author":"李东阳","text":"草深香径合，花冷屟廊空。\n惟有吴宫水，春城四面通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12132,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏台曲五首 其三","author":"李东阳","text":"楼台春后掩，环佩月中行。\n莫上胥门望，寒潮昨夜生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12133,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏台曲五首 其四","author":"李东阳","text":"国亡身亦虏，却载五湖槎。\n借问西施女，何如张丽华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12134,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏台曲五首 其五","author":"李东阳","text":"张王旧时宫，零落数枝柳。\n不是春风生，芳菲讵能久。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12135,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖曲五首 其一","author":"李东阳","text":"湖波绿如剪，美人照青眼。\n一夜愁正深，春风为吹浅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12136,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖曲五首 其二","author":"李东阳","text":"不信湖中好，侬身别有家。\n翻愁岁华尽，不敢采莲花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12137,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖曲五首 其三","author":"李东阳","text":"风落平沙稻，霜垂别渚莲。\n西湖三百亩，强半富儿田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12138,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖曲五首 其四","author":"李东阳","text":"草碧明沙际，霜红试雨初。\n官船荡素桨，惊散一双鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12139,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖曲五首 其五","author":"李东阳","text":"莫唱西湖曲，湖边歌舞稀。\n侬家年少日，游冶误芳菲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12140,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉簪花","author":"李东阳","text":"昨夜花神出蕊宫，绿云袅袅不禁风。\n妆成试照池边影，祗恐搔头落水中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12141,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题赵仲穆挟弹图","author":"李东阳","text":"东风挟弹小城春，游骑飞缰不动尘。\n道上相逢休借问，卫家兄弟霍家亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12142,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读汉史","author":"李东阳","text":"绿囊方底殿屏东，密使潜书昼夜通。\n落尽仙桃春不管，更教双燕舞西风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12143,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕","author":"李东阳","text":"绣户朱帘有路歧，别时嫌早到嫌迟。\n主家只解怜毛羽，涴尽雕梁不自知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12144,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柯敬仲墨竹","author":"李东阳","text":"莫将画竹论难易，刚道繁难简更难。\n君看萧萧只数叶，满堂风雨不胜寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12145,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄莺","author":"李东阳","text":"柳花如雪满春城，始听东风第一声。\n梦里江南旧时路，隔溪烟雨未分明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12146,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春园杂诗四首 其一","author":"李东阳","text":"桔槔庭边非我家，城南小园缲水车。\n直恐此身终是客，门前有地不栽花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12147,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春园杂诗四首 其二","author":"李东阳","text":"庭下猕猴如小儿，攀花折果不停时。\n为怜野意厌羁絷，放著林间高树枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12148,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春园杂诗四首 其三","author":"李东阳","text":"手插河边杨柳枝，眼看成树复成丝。\n不见雪花飞满地，岂知春去已多时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12149,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春园杂诗四首 其四","author":"李东阳","text":"病来无力与春争，看尽花开草又生。\n莫道东君不识面，旧红新绿也关情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12150,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴四首 其一","author":"李东阳","text":"纵酒由来不爱身，吟诗对局总伤神。\n若教此事浑抛却，枉作山林解绶人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12151,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴四首 其二","author":"李东阳","text":"井口辘轳闻水声，园中菜畦浑欲平。\n呼童引水放教去，一夜池头蛙乱鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12152,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴四首 其三","author":"李东阳","text":"老眼昏花懒看书，犹将朱墨校虫鱼。\n闲心自是难抛得，抛得闲心便有余。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12153,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴四首 其四","author":"李东阳","text":"衡岳山高鸿雁稀，荆溪水深鱼蟹肥。\n此身若问归何处，我已无家何处归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12154,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茶陵竹枝歌十首 其一","author":"李东阳","text":"溪南溪北树萦回，洞口桃花几度开。\n枫子鬼来天作雨，云阳仙去水鸣雷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12155,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茶陵竹枝歌十首 其二","author":"李东阳","text":"杨柳深深桑叶新，田家儿女乐芳春。\n刲羊击豕禳瘟鬼，击鼓焚香赛土神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12156,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茶陵竹枝歌十首 其三","author":"李东阳","text":"银烛金杯映绮堂，呼儿击鼓脍肥羊。\n青衫黄帽插花去，知是东家新妇郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12157,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茶陵竹枝歌十首 其四","author":"李东阳","text":"绿鬓荆钗双髻螺，青裙高系小红靴。\n阿?旧是茶城女，教得娃儿能楚歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12158,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茶陵竹枝歌十首 其五","author":"李东阳","text":"拍拍东风燕子寒，卷帘花絮若为看。\n夜深雨脚何曾睡，春水平于养鸭栏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12159,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茶陵竹枝歌十首 其六","author":"李东阳","text":"侬饷蒸藜郎插田，劝郎休上贩茶船。\n郎在田中暮相见，郎乘船去是何年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12160,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茶陵竹枝歌十首 其七","author":"李东阳","text":"春尽田家郎未归，小池凉雨试絺衣。\n园桑绿罢蚕初熟，野麦青时雉始飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12161,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茶陵竹枝歌十首 其八","author":"李东阳","text":"白纸黄坟野草生，柳烟桐火照清明。\n楚娥不识秋千戏，两两沙头接臂行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12162,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茶陵竹枝歌十首 其九","author":"李东阳","text":"渚兰汀芷不胜春，极浦遥山岂解颦。\n谁在长安褷花柳，山中闲煞采芳人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12163,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茶陵竹枝歌十首 其十","author":"李东阳","text":"溪上春流乱石多，劝郎慎勿浪经过。\n莫道茶陵水清浅，年来平地亦风波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12164,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长沙竹枝歌十首 其一","author":"李东阳","text":"三十六湾湾对湾，人家多住白茅间。\n直过洞庭三百里，长沙城北是彤关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12165,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长沙竹枝歌十首 其二","author":"李东阳","text":"南船北船满洞庭，萧公祠前牲酒馨。\n二妃枉作君王后，君看君山山自青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12166,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长沙竹枝歌十首 其三","author":"李东阳","text":"汨罗江头春水生，汨罗江上楚歌声。\n人间若解三闾苦，水底鱼龙亦有情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12167,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长沙竹枝歌十首 其四","author":"李东阳","text":"马殷宫前红水流，定王台下暮云收。\n有井犹名贾太傅，无人不祭李潭州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12168,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长沙竹枝歌十首 其五","author":"李东阳","text":"江头彩旗耀日明，船上挝鼓不停声。\n湖南乐事君记取，五月五日潭州城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12169,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长沙竹枝歌十首 其六","author":"李东阳","text":"潭州城边多野田，黄茅白苇远连天。\n莫言楚国无生理，亩地如今倍直钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12170,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]